// Ch11: the last keeper of the half-drowned temple. Faithful and tired; after Nhoa, afraid of a silence she can't name.
title: ch11_bark_lowlight_keeper
location: ch11/lowlight
---
<<if $ch11_nhoa_bound>>
    Tender as "Lowlight keeper" [afraid]: The cold came up the shaft last night, and then it stopped. Forty years I've kept this temple. It has never stopped. #line:ch11_bark_keeper_001 #long
<<else>>
    Tender as "Lowlight keeper" [exhausted]: The water takes a step a year. We pray on the step above it. There are not many steps left. #line:ch11_bark_keeper_002
<<endif>>
===
